sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Admin as Admin/HR
    participant View as "Web View (admin.master.shifts.create)"
    participant C as ShiftController
    participant S as "Shift Model"
    participant SDT as "ShiftDayTime Model"
    participant DB as "Database"

    Admin->>View: Isi form tambah shift lalu submit
    View->>C: POST /admin/master/shifts

    C->>C: Validasi input (name, time, total_hours, dst)

    alt Data valid
        C->>S: Simpan shift baru
        S->>DB: INSERT INTO shifts (...)
        DB-->>S: shift_id baru

        C->>SDT: Sinkron jadwal per hari (jika per_day_enabled)
        SDT->>DB: INSERT/UPDATE/DELETE shift_day_times sesuai hari aktif

        C-->>View: Redirect ke index + flash success
        View-->>Admin: Data shift baru tampil di daftar
    else Data tidak valid
        C-->>View: Redirect back + errors + old input
        View-->>Admin: Tampilkan pesan validasi gagal
    end
